<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets call warrants on IBM.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets call warrants on IBM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued five million American-style call warrants, on International Business Machines Corp, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $135.00		   PREMIUM	17.06 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.89 DEM		  GEARING	10.08 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.NOV.96-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	05.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   DDF FFT STG	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  $126.00</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
